{{#if askedForYou}}
<mj-text font-size="22px" line-height="30px" font-weight="bold" color="#0b0b0f">A client asked for you</mj-text>
<mj-text>Hello,</mj-text>
<mj-text>A client found you in the ilovelawyer marketplace and sent their case to you, and only you:</mj-text>
{{else}}
<mj-text font-size="22px" line-height="30px" font-weight="bold" color="#0b0b0f">A new client request matches you</mj-text>
<mj-text>Hello,</mj-text>
<mj-text>A client is looking for a lawyer, and their case matches what you take on:</mj-text>
{{/if}}
<mj-text font-size="18px" font-weight="bold" color="#0b0b0f">{{practiceArea}}, {{ukJurisdiction}}</mj-text>
<mj-text>Urgency: {{urgency}}</mj-text>
{{#if askedForYou}}
<mj-text>It's yours to accept until {{routingExpiresAt}}. After that, or if you pass, it goes to other lawyers who match. Once you accept, you have 24 hours to send a quote.</mj-text>
{{else}}
<mj-text>It's open to accept until {{routingExpiresAt}}. The first lawyer to accept holds it for 24 hours.</mj-text>
{{/if}}
<mj-text>Read the anonymised brief in the app before you decide.</mj-text>
<mj-button href="{{inboxLink}}">View client requests</mj-button>
